==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Schiß}} (old spelling)

===Etymology===
From ''[[scheißen]]'' in the figurative sense that someone has so much fear, he shits his pants.

===Noun===
{{head|de|noun|g=m}}

# {{lb|de|vulgar|pejorative}} fear
#: ''Hast du etwa '''Schiss'''?!''
# ''Schiss haben'': to [[be]] [[afraid]]

